# Tests

I can reproduce the issue with a NodeJS script that uses `@dfinity/ic-management`.

```
#!/usr/bin/env node

import { getIdentity } from "./auth.mjs";
import { ICManagementCanister } from "@dfinity/ic-management";
import { createAgent } from "@dfinity/utils";
import { Principal } from "@dfinity/principal";

const identity = await getIdentity();

const satelliteId = process.env.JUNO_SATELLITE_ID;

const agent = await createAgent({
  identity,
});

const { canisterStatus } = ICManagementCanister.create({
  agent,
});

const { status } = await canisterStatus(Principal.fromText(satelliteId));

console.log(status);
```

